{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43590","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 靖恭坊大兴善寺 蛤像联二十字绝句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 靖恭坊大兴善寺 蛤像联二十字绝句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相好全如梵，端倪祗爲隋。\n宁同蚌顽恶，但与鹬相持。\n虽因雀变化，不逐月亏盈。\n纵有天中匠，神工讵可成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}